-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), the fourth letter it encloses: the
-- Director-General of the Ministry of Education to the organisation's
-- chairman (1.8.2011), on budget authorisations for work corners. Its
-- deontic rule's actions are declared with annex ו's (`Oz annex ו action`).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-v`

-- not weighed against `the Equal Pay Law`: the words the search found are
