§ `מכתב נלווה 4`

§§ `מכתב נלווה 4 — פינות עבודה`

-- akn:att_18__hc_1/p1 akn:att_18__hc_1/p2 akn:att_18__hc_1/p3 akn:att_18__hc_1/p4 akn:att_18__hc_1/p5 akn:att_18__hc_1/p6 akn:att_18__hc_1/p7 akn:att_18__hc_1/p8 akn:att_18__hc_1/p9 The transcriber's note naming the letter, and the letter's letterhead, date, references and address; no rule.

-- The Director-General's letter on budget authorisations for work corners:
-- as summed up, the Ministry issues the owners budget authorisations, in
-- the schools joining the reform and by the criteria set (an input), to
-- set up and equip work corners — by the end of September 2011 (30.9.2011,
-- the day included: convention dates.end), counted from the letter's day;
-- for schools that choose to join from the school year "תשס"ג" on — which
-- the corpus marks and reads as תשע"ג — before the opening of the school
-- year concerned; out of the budget set aside for it and under the usual
-- rules.
@ref akn:att_18__hc_1/p10 akn:att_18__hc_1/p11 akn:att_18__hc_1/p12 akn:att_18__hc_1/p13 akn:att_18__hc_1/p14
GIVEN `the school year the school joins in` IS A NUMBER @desc by the calendar year it opens in
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the last day for a school's work-corner authorisation` `the school year the school joins in` IS
    IF `the school year the school joins in` AT LEAST `the school year 5773`
    THEN DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 `the school year the school joins in`
    ELSE DATE_FROM_DMY 30 9 2011

GIVEN `days to that day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `Oz annex ו action`
DECIDE `issuing the work-corner authorisations` `days to that day` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `issue the budget authorisations for work corners`
    WITHIN `days to that day`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "the Director-General's letter of 1.8.2011: the authorisations for work corners are issued by the end of September 2011, and for a school joining later before its year opens"

`why the work-corner criteria are not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "הקריטריונים שנקבעו להקמת פינות עבודה וציודן, התקציב הייעודי והכללים הנהוגים"

-- akn:att_18/p1 akn:att_18/p2 akn:att_18/p3 akn:att_18/p4 akn:att_18/p5 akn:att_18/p6 akn:att_18/p7 akn:att_18/p8 akn:att_18/p9 akn:att_18/p10 akn:att_18/p11 The sign-off, signature and copies; no rule.

§§ `מכתב נלווה 4 -- illustrations`

-- Work corners: by 30.9.2011 for the schools joining in תשע"ב; before
-- 1.9.2013 for one joining in תשע"ד.
#ASSERT `the last day for a school's work-corner authorisation` `the school year 5772` EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 9 2011
#ASSERT `the last day for a school's work-corner authorisation` `the school year 5774` EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2013
